Subject: Backport Apache Druid libthrift 0.24 compatibility for CVE-2026-43871

Description: Backport upstream thrift-extension changes so druid-thrift-extensions builds against libthrift 0.24.0 on Druid 36.0.0 through 38.0.0 release tags without removing the extension from the distribution.
Origin: backport, https://github.com/apache/druid/commit/134d4c8186663cb2ccc32212a646fbdca5676dea
CVE: CVE-2026-43871
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/apache/druid 18ee9bce703ff13bf62094b07b1ebd9257225655 path=extensions-contrib/thrift-extensions
Adaptation: Squashes upstream PR #19764 and commit 1575b72ce259c64b74013224a73cff4660e900fc so thrift bumps 0.13.0 to 0.24.0 on druid-36.0.0 through druid-38.0.0 release tags.
Verify: cmd `dhi def test package/main/druid/debian-13/36.yaml` expect all tests pass
Advisory: https://github.com/apache/druid/pull/19764

diff --git a/extensions-contrib/thrift-extensions/pom.xml b/extensions-contrib/thrift-extensions/pom.xml
--- a/extensions-contrib/thrift-extensions/pom.xml
+++ b/extensions-contrib/thrift-extensions/pom.xml
@@ -36,3 +36,3 @@
   <properties>
-    <thrift.version>0.13.0</thrift.version>
+    <thrift.version>0.24.0</thrift.version>
     <elephantbird.version>4.17</elephantbird.version>
diff --git a/extensions-contrib/thrift-extensions/src/main/java/org/apache/druid/data/input/thrift/ThriftDeserialization.java b/extensions-contrib/thrift-extensions/src/main/java/org/apache/druid/data/input/thrift/ThriftDeserialization.java
